   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Infinitive as noun",
     "texto": [
      "The nominalised infinitive is written with a capital letter and is neuter: **das Lesen**, **das Schwimmen**, **das Reisen**. It can be subject or complement: **Schwimmen ist gesund**; **Das Lesen entspannt mich**. It is also declined: **beim Lesen** (when reading), **die Freude am Lesen** (the joy of reading)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "General expressions",
     "texto": [
      "With the infinitive as subject and **sein** + adjective general truths are stated: **Sport zu treiben ist wichtig** (doing sport is important). **Das Leben** can be the lexical noun «life» or a nominalised infinitive of **leben**; the context determines the reading."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
